# graphify indexing excludes - keep template/scaffolding out of the knowledge graph.
#
# These paths legitimately contain {{PLACEHOLDER}} tokens (filled by /setup) or
# are illustrative scaffolding, not real architecture. Indexing them pollutes
# graph.json / graph.html / GRAPH_REPORT.md with placeholder nodes and spurious
# communities, and trips the "No unfilled placeholders" CI lint
# (.github/workflows/team-context-lint.yml), which excludes these same paths.
#
# graphify already auto-skips graphify-out/ (its own output), so it is not listed here.

# Setup wizard: instance README template + the setup skill itself ({{TEAM_NAME}} etc.)
.claude/skills/setup/

# Example/template system docs (systems/examples/_example-*.md) - scaffolding only.
_example*
